-november-3-over-complaints-including-a-disputed-60000-campaign-contribution-the-judge-refused-delaying-review-until-after-voting/articleshow/135233065.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-mid-term-elections/news/an-indiana-candidate-asked-a-judge-to-force-an-election-commission-meeting-before-november-3-over-complaints-including-a-disputed-60000-campaign-contribution-the-judge-refused-delaying-review-until-after-voting/articleshow/135233065.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-27T17:22:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135233189,imgsize-66897.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[California court orders removal of 19 ficus trees after roots invade neighbour's property again]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135219384.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a protracted legal battle between neighboring homeowners in California, the Fourth District Court has decided that the invasive roots of 19 ficus trees must be completely removed. Although a prior financial settlement provided some relief, the roots continued to cause damage, prompting the affected homeowner to seek a more lasting remedy. The court ruled that total removal of the trees was essential to eliminate the persistent nuisance.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/two-california-neighbours-settled-a-fight-over-38-ficus-trees-with-a-78500-payment-and-19-trees-removed-years-later-roots-invaded-again-and-a-2026-appeals-court-upheld-an-order-to-remove-the-remaining-19-trees/articleshow/135219384.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/two-california-neighbours-settled-a-fight-over-38-ficus-trees-with-a-78500-payment-and-19-trees-removed-years-later-roots-invaded-again-and-a-2026-appeals-court-upheld-an-order-to-remove-the-remaining-19-trees/articleshow/135219384.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-27T18:13:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135234788,imgsize-2766958.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Beyoncé’s foundation gives $50,000 to youth charity]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135233670.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a generous move, Beyoncé’s foundation, BeyGood, has granted $50,000 to In a Perfect World, which concentrates on youth empowerment. This financial support will help expand their educational and leadership initiatives, aiming to reach more young people in need. With its past achievements touching over 50,000 lives worldwide, the organization is crucial in filling the gaps left by funding shortages in schools, striving to uplift disadvantaged communities.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/beyoncs-foundation-gives-50000-to-a-youth-charity-nonprofit-says-its-work-has-already-touched-50000-lives-and-the-new-grant-aims-to-expand-its-education-and-leadership-programmes/articleshow/135233670.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/beyoncs-foundation-gives-50000-to-a-youth-charity-nonprofit-says-its-work-has-already-touched-50000-lives-and-the-new-grant-aims-to-expand-its-education-and-leadership-programmes/articleshow/135233670.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-27T17:44:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135233831,imgsize-191350.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Iowa court removes siblings as executors over disputed farmland deal]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace