11,imgsize-71959.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Pennsylvania tire worker turns discarded rubber into prize-winning fire dragon]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135219263.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-pennsylvania-tire-shop-worker-turned-discarded-rubber-into-a-prize-winning-parade-lion-then-built-an-eight-foot-700-pound-fire-breathing-dragon-that-won-first-prize-and-became-a-roadside-attraction/articleshow/135219263.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-pennsylvania-tire-shop-worker-turned-discarded-rubber-into-a-prize-winning-parade-lion-then-built-an-eight-foot-700-pound-fire-breathing-dragon-that-won-first-prize-and-became-a-roadside-attraction/articleshow/135219263.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-27T17:16:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135219292,imgsize-727728.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nina Dobrev and Shaun White’s $4.3 Million Hollywood Hills Home Reportedly Hits Rental Market at $35,000 a Month]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135231732.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In July 2023, Nina Dobrev and Shaun White bought a stunning Hollywood Hills home for $4.3 million. However, after their engagement ended in September 2025, the couple decided to rent out the property for nearly $35,000 per month. This home symbolized their dreams together, but renovations continued even as they faced their separation, leading to complex decisions about their future ownership of the residence.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-2023-nina-dobrev-and-sh